// Measured default MicroEmulator MIDP display profile for this bounded
// *owned* model. This is a fixed, explicit device choice, not a promise of
// universal Java ME geometry and not an Acotel game-specific branch.
// The owned Displayable.class supplies the same width/height in guest
// bytecode; independently checked pixel/frame oracles guard that contract.
WIDTH := 176
HEIGHT := 176
PIXELS := WIDTH * HEIGHT
ARGB_BYTES := PIXELS * 4
